Token service

- [x] 1 - Balance for a token
- [ ] 2 - History for a token
- [x] 3 - Search for user by (Name, accountName)
- [x] 4 - Send token to user

## Examples

### 1 - Get Token Balance
```
final tokenService = GetIt.I.get<TokenService>();
final res = await tokenService.getTokenBalance(
  userAccount: 'illumination',
  tokenContract: 'hypha.hypha',
  symbol: 'HYPHA',
);
print('Token Res: ${res.asValue!.value.amount} ${res.asValue!.value.asFormattedString()}');
```

### 3 - Search for user by account name prefix
Note: We can't search full names at this time. There's no API for it.

```
final memberService = GetIt.I.get<HyphaMemberService>();
final mres = await memberService.findHyphaAccount(prefix: 'i');
print('Member Res: ${mres.asValue!.value}');
```

### 4 Send token to user
```
final eosService = GetIt.I.get<EOSService>();
// Note: The precision is the number of digits behind the comma - HUSD has a precision of 2
final val = TokenValue.fromString('0.01 HUSD', 'husd.hypha');
final res = await eosService.transferTokens(
  fromAccount: 'nik',
  toAccount: 'gery',
  tokenValue: val,
  network: Networks.telos,
);
print("res: $res");
```
